{"timestamp":"2026-05-30T21:51:18.117Z","level":"info","source":"model","message":"response","data":{"model":"qwen36-35b","text":"\n\nBased on the blueprint, here are all **15 slash commands** available in VoidRift:\n\n## 📋 Slash Commands Reference\n\n| Command | Function |\n|---------|----------|\n| `/tools` | Lists all registered tools available under the current execution mode (`chat`, `plan`, `vibe`) |\n| `/skills` | Opens TUI overlay to browse, discover, and inspect coding guidelines (`SKILL.md` files) |\n| `/agents` | Interactive TUI to manage, toggle, and terminate background agent personas |\n| `/mcp` | TUI overlay to connect/disconnect and manage MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers |\n| `/ideas` | Interactive Ideas Manager — browse, create, delete, and switch between PM ideas |\n| `/templates` | TUI catalog of document layouts and agent prompt instructions with override management |\n| `/compact` | Manually compresses older conversation turns in the Work Layer to reclaim context space |\n| `/clear` | Deletes the active session log and resets to a pristine boot state |\n| `/resume` | Conversation browser — search, rest","toolCalls":[],"usage":{"promptTokens":6220,"completionTokens":935,"totalTokens":7155}}}
